{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462430/extras/a956041c13c1383005b2927bfdfd85d4.avif?t=1767157279\" width=360 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin to strike in a deckbuilding roguelike with a slot machine as your Dungeon Master.</strong> <br><br>Load the reels with weapons, coins, and cursed relics, then let fate tale the reel. Each spin triggers attacks, abilities, and effects as you battle.  <br><br>Build your deck, tweak your odds, and hope the machine is feeling generous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Knobs by playing: Every 15 min of gameplay earns you a random skin drop. Will you get a common silver knob, or a unique ultra rare knob? Knobs can be traded between players, or on the steam marketplace. <br><br>The Machine starts out with minimal items in its deck, as you play you unlock new items to add to the reels. Over 30 items to unlock and explore, Battle a diverse crowd of enemies, and bosses, each adding their own unique relics to your reels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462430/extras/bded732ec4388b3a6ea2dba6ee66761c.avif?t=1767157279\" width=140 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2462430?t=1767157279","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462430/610fc3c40683defab72baf989275cc3409a81b95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767157279","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462430/d03385a3734c8b9dce160843b0aa49da3badbb26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767157279","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462430/d03385a3734c8b9dc